00:48:06,390 --> 00:48:14,551
So when it becomes really really bad is when you do not really know that there is a duplicate somewhere else. It may look differently.

487
00:48:14,551 --> 00:48:19,589
It may be different code, but it's kind of a still a knowledge duplicate, right?

