00:48:31,270 --> 00:48:37,670
and that's the way towards driving your system crazy having diverged duplicates which are not really duplicates anymore.

491
00:48:37,670 --> 00:48:43,430
So if you can get rid of the unknown unknowns problems, I think you're already good enough.

